libc++ <optional> enable-if ctor-pair shape: same-signature member ctor
templates collide on their symbol identifier; the collision branches of
convert_function_template returned WITHOUT making the template scope a
secondary scope of the class scope, so the constructor pass's typecheck
of the dependent NTTP type failed "symbol '_Up' is unknown" and the
whole instantiation was abandoned (main silently dropped).  Fixed
2026-08-04 (round 11) by registering the scope exactly as the
'#sfinae_alt' twin branch already did.  History: earlier degenerate
38-line reduction gated on this same family; replaced by this faithful
minimal shape per the round-9 re-scoping note.
